# ── Runtime Uploads (Exclude uploaded hazard/maintenance images) ──────────────
uploads/
**/uploads/*
!**/uploads/.gitkeep
!**/uploads/sample_*.jpg
!**/uploads/sample_*.png
!public/uploads/sample_*.jpg
!public/sample_*.jpg

